高于1000毫安时，那些想着扩容1500毫安时的我拜托你现实一点[捂脸]。&lt;br&gt;当然，99元换4700毫安时的原装电池其实也不算亏了。&lt;br&gt;另外，买这个确认下自己的购机天数，购买要求是在1278天以内才能买&lt;br&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/OriginOS6?type=0&quot;&gt;#OriginOS6#&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/vivoX100Pro?type=0&quot;&gt;#vivoX100Pro#&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/vivoX100Ultra?type=0&quot;&gt;#vivoX100Ultra#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/fce2cafc45acc0e47d5f594f23d4530c.jpg&quot; &gt;</description><link>https://www.coolapk.com/feed/72278260</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.coolapk.com/feed/72278260</guid><pubDate>Wed, 10 Jun 2026 22:13:05 GMT</pubDate><author>旦尼丁吃瓜的车厘子</author></item><item><title>iPhone17和iPhone Air，价格相差一百 怎么选择，听说ios27大大提升性能 #iPhone17ProMax# #iPhone17Pro# #iPhoneAir#</title><description>&lt;p&gt;iPhone17和iPhone Air，价格相差一百
